@startuml sequence-check-availability
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
title Sequence — Check availability (UC4a, included in UC4 and UC8)
control ":ReservationService" as Res
database ":Database" as DB

note over Res
  Called from UC4 (while the customer picks dates
  and again on submit) and from UC8 (before confirming)
end note

[-> Res : is_car_available(car, start, end)
Res -> DB : query(Reservation) where\n car = car,\n status = CONFIRMED,\n start_date < end,\n end_date > start
note right of DB
  DRAFT and CANCELLED
  reservations are ignored —
  only a CONFIRMED one
  blocks the slot
end note
DB --> Res : overlapping : Reservation | none

alt no overlapping reservation
  [<-- Res : true (car available)
else an overlapping CONFIRMED reservation exists
  [<-- Res : false (car not available)
end
@enduml
